                    on how to reset it.
                  </span>
                </p>
                <div class="flex justify-center py-40">
                  <button type="submit" class="back-to-login text-16 px-24 py-16 leading-4 w-full lg:w-40 min-w-160 bg-primary-orange text-white hover:bg-accent-deepOrange rounded-button font-dinBold" id="">
                    <span class=""> Back</span>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Forgot M1 ID message END -->

